{"real": false, "dur": 56.6, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 6.17, "text": "So how do I take what I’ve built for French and adapt it to Chinese?", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "how", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "do", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "I", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "take", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "what", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "built", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "for", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "French", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "and", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "adapt", "s": 4.63}, {"w": "it", "s": 5.02}, {"w": "to", "s": 5.4}, {"w": "Chinese?", "s": 5.78}]}, {"start": 6.52, "end": 8.83, "text": "I do it in three steps.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "do", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "it", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "in", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "three", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "steps.", "s": 8.44}]}, {"start": 9.18, "end": 11.1, "text": "Step one: keep the frame.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "s": 9.18}, {"w": "one:", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "keep", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "frame.", "s": 10.72}]}, {"start": 11.45, "end": 15.3, "text": "Build the parts that work for any language just once.", "words": [{"w": "Build", "s": 11.45}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.83}, {"w": "parts", "s": 12.22}, {"w": "that", "s": 12.6}, {"w": "work", "s": 12.99}, {"w": "for", "s": 13.37}, {"w": "any", "s": 13.76}, {"w": "language", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "just", "s": 14.53}, {"w": "once.", "s": 14.91}]}, {"start": 15.65, "end": 21.03, "text": "There are also two important rules built into it: the catalogue and the spiral.", "words": [{"w": "There", "s": 15.65}, {"w": "are", "s": 16.03}, {"w": "also", "s": 16.42}, {"w": "two", "s": 16.8}, {"w": "important", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "rules", "s": 17.57}, {"w": "built", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "into", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "it:", "s": 18.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 19.11}, {"w": "catalogue", "s": 19.49}, {"w": "and", "s": 19.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 20.26}, {"w": "spiral.", "s": 20.65}]}, {"start": 21.38, "end": 24.07, "text": "I’ll come to those in a moment.", "words": [{"w": "I’ll", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "come", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "to", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "those", "s": 22.53}, {"w": "in", "s": 22.92}, {"w": "a", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "moment.", "s": 23.69}]}, {"start": 24.42, "end": 26.35, "text": "Step two: change the settings.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "two:", "s": 24.81}, {"w": "change", "s": 25.19}, {"w": "the", "s": 25.58}, {"w": "settings.", "s": 25.96}]}, {"start": 26.7, "end": 31.31, "text": "The exercises still work the same way, but learners make different choices.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 26.7}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 27.08}, {"w": "still", "s": 27.47}, {"w": "work", "s": 27.85}, {"w": "the", "s": 28.23}, {"w": "same", "s": 28.62}, {"w": "way,", "s": 29.0}, {"w": "but", "s": 29.39}, {"w": "learners", "s": 29.77}, {"w": "make", "s": 30.16}, {"w": "different", "s": 30.54}, {"w": "choices.", "s": 30.93}]}, {"start": 31.66, "end": 33.58, "text": "Step three: fill the slots.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "s": 31.66}, {"w": "three:", "s": 32.05}, {"w": "fill", "s": 32.43}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.82}, {"w": "slots.", "s": 33.2}]}, {"start": 33.93, "end": 39.7, "text": "Use the new textbook to work out what learners need to be able to do.", "words": [{"w": "Use", "s": 33.93}, {"w": "the", "s": 34.32}, {"w": "new", "s": 34.7}, {"w": "textbook", "s": 35.09}, {"w": "to", "s": 35.47}, {"w": "work", "s": 35.86}, {"w": "out", "s": 36.24}, {"w": "what", "s": 36.63}, {"w": "learners", "s": 37.01}, {"w": "need", "s": 37.4}, {"w": "to", "s": 37.78}, {"w": "be", "s": 38.17}, {"w": "able", "s": 38.55}, {"w": "to", "s": 38.93}, {"w": "do.", "s": 39.32}]}, {"start": 40.05, "end": 43.13, "text": "That’s where the teacher does the real work.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 40.05}, {"w": "where", "s": 40.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 40.82}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 41.21}, {"w": "does", "s": 41.59}, {"w": "the", "s": 41.98}, {"w": "real", "s": 42.36}, {"w": "work.", "s": 42.75}]}, {"start": 43.48, "end": 45.02, "text": "Think of a loom.", "words": [{"w": "Think", "s": 43.48}, {"w": "of", "s": 43.87}, {"w": "a", "s": 44.25}, {"w": "loom.", "s": 44.63}]}, {"start": 45.37, "end": 47.29, "text": "The loom stays the same.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 45.37}, {"w": "loom", "s": 45.75}, {"w": "stays", "s": 46.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 46.52}, {"w": "same.", "s": 46.91}]}, {"start": 47.64, "end": 48.8, "text": "That’s the frame.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 47.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.03}, {"w": "frame.", "s": 48.41}]}, {"start": 49.15, "end": 52.22, "text": "The thread and pattern change with each language.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 49.15}, {"w": "thread", "s": 49.53}, {"w": "and", "s": 49.92}, {"w": "pattern", "s": 50.3}, {"w": "change", "s": 50.68}, {"w": "with", "s": 51.07}, {"w": "each", "s": 51.45}, {"w": "language.", "s": 51.84}]}, {"start": 52.57, "end": 55.65, "text": "Let’s take the steps one at a time.", "words": [{"w": "Let’s", "s": 52.57}, {"w": "take", "s": 52.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.34}, {"w": "steps", "s": 53.73}, {"w": "one", "s": 54.11}, {"w": "at", "s": 54.5}, {"w": "a", "s": 54.88}, {"w": "time.", "s": 55.27}]}]}